(2023, 'Monterra Lounge Chair', 'owlee-monterra-lounge-chair-421-cc', '421-CC', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Lounge Chair showcases the collection’s rustic Southwestern and Mediterranean influences with handcrafted detailing and rich textural appeal. Its durable wrought iron frame and plush cushions create a timeless outdoor lounge chair ideal for patios and courtyard seating areas. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Lounge Chair showcases the collection’s rustic Southwestern and Mediterranean influences with handcrafted detailing and rich textural appeal. Its durable wrought iron frame and plush cushions create a timeless outdoor lounge chair ideal for patios and courtyard seating areas. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, 2, '1500.00', NULL, '80.00', 'H 43.75" × W 42.75" × D 38.5"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.712Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.175Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"43.75","collection":"Monterra","weight_lbs":"80","arm_height_in":"25.25","seat_height_in":"20","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-con