(2025, 'Monterra Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-monterra-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-421-sr', '421-SR', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair brings Mediterranean elegance to outdoor entertaining with added motion. Featuring a handcrafted wrought iron frame with smooth swivel and gentle rocking action, this outdoor swivel lounge chair delivers comfort, durability, and timeless rustic charm. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair brings Mediterranean elegance to outdoor entertaining with added motion. Featuring a handcrafted wrought iron frame with smooth swivel and gentle rocking action, this outdoor swivel lounge chair delivers comfort, durability, and timeless rustic charm. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 44.5" × W 42.5" × D 37.75"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 2, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.725Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.196Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"44.5","collection":"Monterra","weight_lbs":"94 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"25","seat_height_in":"19.5","spec_sheet_pdf":"h