(2026, 'Monterra Love Seat', 'owlee-monterra-love-seat-427-2s', '427-2S', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Love Seat reflects the warm, inviting aesthetic of Southwestern and Mediterranean design. Its decorative wrought iron frame and comfortable cushions make this outdoor love seat a versatile, elegant addition to a variety of outdoor settings. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 'The O.W. Lee Monterra Love Seat reflects the warm, inviting aesthetic of Southwestern and Mediterranean design. Its decorative wrought iron frame and comfortable cushions make this outdoor love seat a versatile, elegant addition to a variety of outdoor settings. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 43.75" × W 67.5" × D 38.5"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 3, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.730Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.202Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"43.75","collection":"Monterra","weight_lbs":"120 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"25","seat_height_in":"20","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/2026-Monterra_Retail_SpecSheet_427-2S-Love-Seat.pdf","depth_le