(2045, 'Classico Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-lounge-chair-956-ccw', '956-CCW', 'If you’re looking for a classic outdoor lounge chair that feels just as good as it looks, the O.W. Lee Classico Lounge Chair delivers. It brings the collection’s signature traditional style into a relaxed, lounge-ready design, complete with decorative metalwork and plush cushions that invite you to sit back and stay awhile. It’s the kind of chair that instantly makes an outdoor space feel warm, comfortable, and refined. Like everything O.W. Lee makes, the Classico Lounge Chair is built to last. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, while the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can enjoy both comfort and peace of mind season after season. Customization is where this chair really shines. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that fits your space and your style perfectly. Whether you’re furnishing a cozy patio or a full outdoor living area, the Classico Lounge Chair offers timeless design, exceptional comfort, and craftsmanship you can trust.', 'If you’re looking for a classic outdoor lounge chair that feels just as good as it looks, the O.W. Lee Classico Lounge Chair delivers. It brings the collection’s signature traditional style into a relaxed, lounge-ready design, complete with decorative metalwork and plush cushions that invite you to sit back and stay awhile. It’s the kind of chair that instantly makes an outdoor space feel warm, comfortable, and refined. Like everything O.W. Lee makes, the Classico Lounge Chair is built to last. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, while the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can enjoy both comfort and peace of mind season after season. Customization is where this chair really shines. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that fits your space and your style perfectly. Whether you’re furnishing a cozy patio or a full outdoor living area, the Classico Lounge Chair offers timeless design, exceptional comfort, and craftsmanship you can trust.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, '46.00', 'H 38.5" × W 28" × D 36.75"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 22, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.818Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.004Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"38.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"46","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part9.pdf","depth_length_in":"36.75","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2046, 'Classico Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-956-srw', '956-SRW', 'The O.W. Lee Classico Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair blends graceful design with gentle movement. Featuring smooth swivel and rocking motion, this outdoor lounge chair offers relaxed comfort wrapped in traditional sophistication. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 'The O.W. Lee Classico Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair blends graceful design with gentle movement. Featuring smooth swivel and rocking motion, this outdoor lounge chair offers relaxed comfort wrapped in traditional sophistication. O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 40.75" × W 28" × D 34.25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 23, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.822Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.043Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"40.75","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"57 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"26.75","seat_height_in":"17.75","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part11.pdf","depth_length_in":"34.25","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","cl