(2047, 'Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-spring-base-lounge-chair-956-sbt', '956-SBT', 'If you love the look of classic outdoor furniture but want a little extra comfort, the O.W. Lee Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair is a perfect fit. It takes the timeless elegance of the Classico collection and adds gentle motion, thanks to a spring-supported base that responds as you sit and relax. The result is a lounge chair that feels supportive, comfortable, and effortlessly inviting. Ornate metal details highlight the collection’s European-inspired craftsmanship, giving the chair a refined, old-world appeal. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, this chair is built for long-term outdoor living. The wrought iron frame is protected by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is backed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics also carry a 5-year warranty, so you can enjoy comfort and durability with confidence. Personalizing your chair is easy. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that feels uniquely yours. Whether you’re designing a quiet retreat or a sophisticated outdoor lounge, the Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers classic style, subtle motion, and lasting comfort.', 'If you love the look of classic outdoor furniture but want a little extra comfort, the O.W. Lee Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair is a perfect fit. It takes the timeless elegance of the Classico collection and adds gentle motion, thanks to a spring-supported base that responds as you sit and relax. The result is a lounge chair that feels supportive, comfortable, and effortlessly inviting. Ornate metal details highlight the collection’s European-inspired craftsmanship, giving the chair a refined, old-world appeal. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, this chair is built for long-term outdoor living. The wrought iron frame is protected by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is backed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics also carry a 5-year warranty, so you can enjoy comfort and durability with confidence. Personalizing your chair is easy. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options to create a look that feels uniquely yours. Whether you’re designing a quiet retreat or a sophisticated outdoor lounge, the Classico Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers classic style, subtle motion, and lasting comfort.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, '58.00', 'H 41" × W 28" × D 33.25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 24, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.826Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.053Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"41","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"58","arm_height_in":"26.5","seat_height_in":"17.5","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part10.pdf","depth_length_in":"33.25","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2048, 'Classico High-Back Spring Base Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-high-back-spring-base-lounge-chair-937-sbw', '937-SBW', 'If you want maximum comfort with a more commanding, classic look, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers on all fronts. Its taller back provides extra support for relaxed lounging, while the spring base adds gentle motion that responds naturally as you sit. Together, they create a chair that feels as good as it looks--supportive, comfortable, and inviting. True to the Classico collection, this chair features a stately, Old World silhouette with refined detailing that brings a sense of timeless European elegance to any outdoor space. It’s an ideal choice for those who appreciate traditional design but don’t want to compromise on comfort. Built with O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship, the frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, ensuring long-lasting performance outdoors. To make it your own, choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options. Whether it’s part of a full seating arrangement or a standout lounge piece, the Classico High Back Spring Base Lounge Chair offers elevated comfort, subtle motion, and enduring style.', 'If you want maximum comfort with a more commanding, classic look, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Spring Base Lounge Chair delivers on all fronts. Its taller back provides extra support for relaxed lounging, while the spring base adds gentle motion that responds naturally as you sit. Together, they create a chair that feels as good as it looks--supportive, comfortable, and inviting. True to the Classico collection, this chair features a stately, Old World silhouette with refined detailing that brings a sense of timeless European elegance to any outdoor space. It’s an ideal choice for those who appreciate traditional design but don’t want to