(2049, 'Classico High-Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-classico-high-back-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-937-srw', '937-SRW', 'If comfort is your top priority but you still want timeless style, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair checks every box. The tall, supportive back is perfect for leaning in and relaxing, while the smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion let you move naturally and stay comfortable for longer stretches outdoors. It’s an ideal chair for conversations, quiet moments, and everything in between. Design-wise, this chair stays true to the Classico collection’s classic European influence. Refined detailing and an elegant silhouette give it a polished, Old World look that elevates any patio or outdoor living space. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, quality and durability come standard. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can relax knowing your chair is built to last. Personalizing your look is easy with 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options. Whether it stands alone or completes a full seating group, the Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair offers exceptional comfort, graceful motion, and enduring craftsmanship.', 'If comfort is your top priority but you still want timeless style, the O.W. Lee Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair checks every box. The tall, supportive back is perfect for leaning in and relaxing, while the smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion let you move naturally and stay comfortable for longer stretches outdoors. It’s an ideal chair for conversations, quiet moments, and everything in between. Design-wise, this chair stays true to the Classico collection’s classic European influence. Refined detailing and an elegant silhouette give it a polished, Old World look that elevates any patio or outdoor living space. As with all O.W. Lee furniture, quality and durability come standard. The wrought iron frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, so you can relax knowing your chair is built to last. Personalizing your look is easy with 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options. Whether it stands alone or completes a full seating group, the Classico High Back Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair offers exceptional comfort, graceful motion, and enduring craftsmanship.', 13, 43, 2, NULL, NULL, '58.00', 'H 44.5" × W 28" × D 34"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 26, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.833Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.073Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"44.5","collection":"Classico","weight_lbs":"58","arm_height_in":"26.75","seat_height_in":"17.75","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Classico_Retail_SpecSheets_2026-upd_Part13.pdf","depth_length_in":"34","width_diameter_in":"28"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","classico","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
