(2094, 'Arc Swivel Rocker Dining Arm Chair', 'owlee-arc-swivel-rocker-dining-arm-chair-3433-sr', '3433-SR', 'The O.W. Lee Arc Swivel Rocker Dining Arm Chair enhances contemporary dining with smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion. Flowing lines and minimalist detailing echo the collection’s yacht-inspired design while offering relaxed functionality. Quality & Customization O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 'The O.W. Lee Arc Swivel Rocker Dining Arm Chair enhances contemporary dining with smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion. Flowing lines and minimalist detailing echo the collection’s yacht-inspired design while offering relaxed functionality. Quality & Customization O.W. Lee is renowned for its exceptional quality, supported by an industry-leading warranty. Our frames are covered by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed against fading, blistering, and peeling for 5 years. Cushions and fabrics are also backed by a 5-year warranty. With a selection of 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 sling fabrics, customers can easily customize each piece to seamlessly complement their individual style.', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, '38.00', 'H 36.5" × W 24" × D 28.25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 71, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:46.995Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.565Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"36.5","collection":"Arc","weight_lbs":"38","arm_height_in":"25","seat_height_in":"19.5","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/ARC_Retail_SpecSheet_2026_3