(2097, 'Santorini 28" x 72" Occasional Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-santorini-28-x-72-occasional-height-fire-pit-5110-2872o', '5110-2872O', 'Inspired by the timeless beauty of Mediterranean architecture, the iron Santorini Fire Pit blends old-world charm with modern durability, creating a striking focal point for evening gatherings or serene solo moments. Its fully welded iron construction provides exceptional strength and stability while delivering a refined, architectural presence outdoors. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Santorini Fire Pit allows you to tailor every detail to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant iron frame finishes and sixteen striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With two height options and six versatile sizes, Santorini adapts beautifully to any space or style.', 'Inspired by the timeless beauty of Mediterranean architecture, the iron Santorini Fire Pit blends old-world charm with modern durability, creating a striking focal point for evening gatherings or serene solo moments. Its fully welded iron construction provides exceptional strength and stability while delivering a refined, architectural presence outdoors. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Santorini Fire Pit allows you to tailor every detail to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant iron frame finishes and sixteen striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With two height options and six versatile sizes, Santorini adapts beautifully to any space or style.', 13, 45, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 72" × D 28"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 74, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.007Z'::time