(2109, 'Capri 30" x 50" Chat Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-capri-30-x-50-chat-height-fire-pit-5112-3050c', '5112-3050C', 'Elevate your outdoor gatherings with the refined versatility of the O.W. Lee Capri Fire Pit Collection. Designed with clean lines and a timeless modern aesthetic, Capri steel fire pits provide inviting warmth while serving as a sophisticated focal point for patios, terraces, and outdoor living spaces. Expertly crafted in the USA, each Capri Fire Pit pairs a fully welded iron base with a durable porcelain tile top, delivering exceptional strength, stability, and long-term performance. The porcelain surface is engineered to withstand heat, moisture, and outdoor exposure while maintaining its refined appearance. With 16 distinctive porcelain tile options and 10 elegant frame finishes, Capri offers extensive customization to complement both contemporary and transitional outdoor designs. Built to last and backed by one of the best warranties in the industry, Capri fire pits reflect O.W. Lee’s uncompromising commitment to quality. The frame is protected by a 20-year structural warranty, while the finish, porcelain tiles, components, and accessories are covered for 5 years, providing confidence season after season. Designed for flexibility and reliable performance, Capri fire pits are available with manual or electronic ignition. Each unit ships propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas using an optional conversion kit. Offered in two height options and seven versatile sizes, the Capri Collection delivers a tailored solution for a wide range of outdoor layouts, combining craftsmanship, customization, and enduring outdoor comfort.', 'Elevate your outdoor gatherings with the refined versatility of the O.W. Lee Capri Fire Pit Collection. Designed with clean lines and a timeless modern aesthetic, Capri steel fire pits provide inviting warmth while serving as a sophisticated focal point for patios, terraces, and outdoor living spaces. Expertly craf