(2122, 'Phoenix 42" Rd. Chat Height Phoenix Fire Pit', 'owlee-phoenix-42-rd-chat-height-phoenix-fire-pit-5113-42rdc-ph', '5113-42RDC-PH', 'The iron Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Its solid iron construction provides exceptional strength while anchoring the design with a refined, architectural presence. Handcrafted in the USA, Phoenix offers extensive customization with 10 elegant iron frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. Offered in two heights and two sizes, the Phoenix Fire Pit delivers sculptural beauty with long-lasting iron durability.', 'The iron Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Its solid iron construction provides exceptional strength while anchoring the design with a refined, architectural presence. Handcrafted in the USA, Phoenix offers extensive customization with 10 elegant iron frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. Offered in two heights and two sizes, the Phoenix Fire Pit delivers sculptural beauty with long-lasting iron durability.', 13, 45, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 24" × W 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 99, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.096Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.166Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Phoenix","weight_lbs":"172 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"—","seat_height_in":"—","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_Phoenix-5113-42RDC.pd