(2123, 'Phoenix 42" Rd. Occasional Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-phoenix-42-rd-occasional-height-fire-pit-5113-42rdo', '5113-42RDO', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 100, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.099Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.306Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"19","collection":"Volante","weight_lbs":"115 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"—","seat_height_in":"—","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_5123-42RDO-Volante.pdf","width_diameter_in":"42"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","phoenix","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
