(2126, 'Elba 30" Rd. Chat Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-elba-30-rd-chat-height-fire-pit-5122-30rdc', '5122-30RDC', 'Sleek, stylish, and distinctly modern, the all-aluminum Elba Fire Pit brings a bold architectural statement to your outdoor space. Designed with a clean, linear aesthetic, Elba illuminates the elegance of O.W. Lee’s unmatched craftsmanship in aluminum with a durable commercial grade porcelain top to create a fire feature that feels both contemporary and timeless. Artisan-crafted in the USA, the Elba Fire Pit offers exceptional customization to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and 16 striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With four height options and six versatile sizes, the Elba fire pit is our most extensive Casual Fireside collection.', 'Sleek, stylish, and distinctly modern, the all-aluminum Elba Fire Pit brings a bold architectural statement to your outdoor space. Designed with a clean, linear aesthetic, Elba illuminates the elegance of O.W. Lee’s unmatched craftsmanship in aluminum with a durable commercial grade porcelain top to create a fire feature that feels both contemporary and timeless. Artisan-crafted in the USA, the Elba Fire Pit offers exceptional customization to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and 16 striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With four height options and six versatile sizes, the Elba fire pit is our most extensive Casual Fireside collection.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 25" × W 30"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 103, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.115Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.187Z'::timestam