(2142, 'Moda 25" x 45" Occasional Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-moda-25-x-45-occasional-height-fire-pit-5153-2545o', '5153-2545O', 'Clean lines, modern form, and advanced materials define the aluminum Moda Fire Pit by O.W. Lee. Featuring a sleek, low-profile aluminum frame and a premium Dekton® hearth top, Moda delivers contemporary style with lightweight strength and weather-resistant performance. Proudly made in the USA, Moda is available in 10 aluminum frame finishes and two Dekton® top options. Choose manual or electronic ignition, with each model shipping propane-ready and convertible to natural gas. Offered in two streamlined sizes, Moda serves as a refined aluminum focal point for modern outdoor entertaining.', 'Clean lines, modern form, and advanced materials define the aluminum Moda Fire Pit by O.W. Lee. Featuring a sleek, low-profile aluminum frame and a premium Dekton® hearth top, Moda delivers contemporary style with lightweight strength and weather-resistant performance. Proudly made in the USA, Moda is available in 10 aluminum frame finishes and two Dekton® top options. Choose manual or electronic ignition, with each model shipping propane-ready and convertible to natural gas. Offered in two streamlined sizes, Moda serves as a refined aluminum focal point for modern outdoor entertaining.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 45" × D 25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 122, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.191Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.288Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"19","collection":"Moda","weight_lbs":"98 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"—","seat_height_in":"—","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_5153-2545O-Moda.pdf","depth_length_in":"25","width_diameter_in":"45"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","moda","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
