(2144, 'Forma 25" x 45" Occasional Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-forma-25-x-45-occasional-height-fire-pit-5152-2545o', '5152-2545O', 'Strikingly modern and expertly crafted, the aluminum Forma Fire Pit by O.W. Lee brings bold architectural design to outdoor spaces. Defined by clean geometric lines, Forma highlights the strength, precision, and corrosion resistance of premium aluminum construction. Made in the USA, Forma is available in 10 aluminum frame finishes. Choose manual or electronic ignition, with each unit propane-ready and convertible to natural gas. Offered in two streamlined sizes, Forma’s sculptural aluminum form delivers a perfect balance of art and function.', 'Strikingly modern and expertly crafted, the aluminum Forma Fire Pit by O.W. Lee brings bold architectural design to outdoor spaces. Defined by clean geometric lines, Forma highlights the strength, precision, and corrosion resistance of premium aluminum construction. Made in the USA, Forma is available in 10 aluminum frame finishes. Choose manual or electronic ignition, with each unit propane-ready and convertible to natural gas. Offered in two streamlined sizes, Forma’s sculptural aluminum form delivers a perfect balance of art and function.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 45" × D 25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 124, TRUE, '2026-05-03T01:40:47.200Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.297Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"19","collection":"Forma","weight_lbs":"185 (pkg)","arm_height_in":"—","seat_height_in":"—","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_5152-2545O-Forma.pdf","depth_length_in":"25","width_diameter_in":"45"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","forma","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
