(2286, 'Lakeside Sling High Back Swivel Rocker', 'tropitone-740570', '740570', '<p>Anchor any outdoor dining set with a pair of swivel rockers. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Sling Swivel Rocker invites modern families to connect with nature. Lakeside Sling Swivel Rockers feature Tropitone''s durable sling fabric, which will have guests rocking in relaxation. The ergonomically designed back of the dining chair adds another level of comfort to your outdoor dining experience. The all-aluminum swivel base means years of maintenance free enjoyment outdoors. The Lakeside Sling Swivel Rocker invites you to relax and linger long after the meal is over.</p>', NULL, 25, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.262Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.631Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"29.5\"","Width":"25.5\"","Height":"41.5\"","Arm Height":"25\"","Seat Height":"17.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2287, 'Lakeside Sling Swivel Bar Stool', 'tropitone-740527-28', '740527-28', '<p>Socializing al fresco has never been more alluring. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Sling Bar Stool invites guests to connect with nature. Lakeside Sling Bar Stools feature your choice of Tropitone''s durable sling fabric especially designed for comfort and ease of maintenance. The Lakeside Sling Bar Stool invites you to relax and linger long after the party is over.</p>', NULL, 25, 47, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.265Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.515Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"28.5\"","Width":"25.5\"","Height":"48.5\"","Arm Height":"35.5\"","Seat Height":"28\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2288, 'Lakeside Sling Chaise Lounge', 'tropitone-740532', '740532', '<p>Sling outdoor pieces have become a favorite for outdoor furniture sets. The Lakeside Sling Chaise Lounge combines an alluring sleek profile with the comfort of a lush fabric seating surface, perfect for lounging poolside. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Sling Chaise Lounge features Tropitone''s durable sling fabric especially designed for comfort and ease of maintenance. The Lakeside Sling Chaise Lounge invites you to relax and linger long after the pool party is over.</p>', NULL, 25, 42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.268Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.610Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"80.5\"","Width":"29\"","Height":"46.5\"","Arm Height":"22.5\"","Seat Height":"15\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2289, 'Lakeside Padded Sling High Back Dining Chair', 'tropitone-740501ps', '740501PS', '<p>Dining al fresco has never been more alluring. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Padded Sling Dining Chair invites modern families to connect with nature. Lakeside Padded Sling Dining Chair features your choice of Tropitone''s durable fabric especially designed for comfort and ease of maintenance. The ergonomically designed high back of the outdoor dining chair adds another level of comfort to any outdoor dining experience. The Lakeside Padded Sling Dining Chair invites you to relax and linger long after the meal is over.</p>', NULL, 25, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.272Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.617Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"29.5\"","Width":"25.5\"","Height":"41.5\"","Arm Height":"25\"","Seat Height":"17.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2290, 'Lakeside Padded Sling High Back Swivel Rocker', 'tropitone-740570ps', '740570PS', '<p>Anchor any outdoor dining set with a pair of swivel rockers. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Padded Sling Swivel Rocker invites modern families to connect with nature. Lakeside Padded Sling Swivel Rockers feature Tropitone''s durable fabric, which will have guests rocking in relaxation. The ergonomically designed back of the dining chair adds another level of comfort to your outdoor dining experience. The all-aluminum swivel base means years of maintenance free enjoyment outdoors. The Lakeside Padded Sling Swivel Rocker invites you to relax and linger long after the meal is over.</p>', NULL, 25, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.275Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.631Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"29.5\"","Width":"25.5\"","Height":"41.5\"","Arm Height":"25\"","Seat Height":"17.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
