(2292, 'Lakeside Padded Sling Chaise Lounge', 'tropitone-741232ps', '741232PS', '<p>The Tropitone® Lakeside Padded Sling Padded Chaise Lounge is perfect by the pool or on the patio. Designed by Peter Homestead, the Lakeside Padded Sling Chaise Lounges features durable sling fabric and extruded aluminum for comfort and ease of maintenance. So sit back, relax in the Lakeside Padded Sling Chaise Lounge and enjoy outdoors.</p>', NULL, 25, 42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-21T23:50:59.282Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.610Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"80.5\"","Width":"29\"","Height":"46.5\"","Arm Height":"22.5\"","Seat Height":"15\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(2293, 'Greenwich Aluminum Market', 'greenwich-aluminum-market-frankford', '845CAM', 'The Greenwich aluminum market umbrella is elegant, refined and sure to satisfy your need for shade in any upscale commercial or residential setting. Available in 5 sizes, there are options for any space and shade need. The easy glide pulley system allows for easy opening and closing. Its sturdy aluminum frame, polished silver finish, and solid marine chrome plated aluminum finial add the perfect touch to give your cherished outdoor space the enhanced appearance found at luxury resorts, hotels, and restaurants.
