(5177, 'Avana Crescent Sofa', 'owlee-avana-avana-crescent-sofa-65168-3s', '65168-3S', 'The Avana Crescent Sofa makes a statement without saying a word. With its sweeping crescent silhouette and sculptural frame, this piece is designed to anchor a space beautifully--whether gathered around a fire feature or positioned as a standalone focal point. The curved profile naturally encourages conversation, creating an intimate, inviting atmosphere while offering generous seating. Handcrafted with the signature quality and durability you expect from O.W. Lee, the Avana Crescent Sofa features a fully welded aluminum frame built to withstand the elements. Plush, tailored cushions provide exceptional comfort and long-lasting performance, available in a wide range of premium outdoor fabrics to suit any design vision. Elegant from every angle, the Avana Crescent Sofa blends refined lines with enduring construction—bringing both drama and comfort to luxury outdoor living spaces.', 'The Avana Crescent Sofa makes a statement without saying a word. With its sweeping crescent silhouette and sculptural frame, this piece is designed to anchor a space beautifully--whether gathered around a fire feature or positioned as a standalone focal point. The curved profile naturally encourages conversation, creating an intimate, inviting atmosphere while offering generous seating. Handcrafted with the signature quality and durability you expect from O.W. Lee, the Avana Crescent Sofa features a fully welded aluminum frame built to withstand the elements. Plush, tailored cushions provide exceptional comfort and long-lasting performance, available in a wide range of premium outdoor fabrics to suit any design vision. Elegant from every angle, the Avana Crescent Sofa blends refined lines with enduring construction—bringing both drama and comfort to luxury outdoor living spaces.', 13, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 223, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17