(5178, 'Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair', 'owlee-avana-padded-sling-dining-arm-chair-65192p-a', '65192P-A', 'The O.W. Lee Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair brings modern elegance and comfort to any outdoor dining space. Its cushioned sling seat combines with a clean-lined aluminum frame to create a chair that feels refined, inviting, and perfectly suited for everyday use. Designed with both style and practicality in mind, it’s a great choice for those who want high-quality outdoor furniture at a more accessible price point without sacrificing design or durability. Quality & Customization Built with O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship, this chair is made to last. The aluminum frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, ensuring long-lasting comfort and performance outdoors. Customization is effortless. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 durable sling fabrics, to create a look that fits your outdoor space perfectly. The Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair delivers style, comfort, and exceptional value, making it an ideal choice for customers seeking upscale outdoor dining at a smart price.', 'The O.W. Lee Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair brings modern elegance and comfort to any outdoor dining space. Its cushioned sling seat combines with a clean-lined aluminum frame to create a chair that feels refined, inviting, and perfectly suited for everyday use. Designed with both style and practicality in mind, it’s a great choice for those who want high-quality outdoor furniture at a more accessible price point without sacrificing design or durability. Quality & Customization Built with O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship, this chair is made to last. The aluminum frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, ensuring long-lasting comfort and performance outdoors. Customization is effortless. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 durable sling fabrics, to create a look that fits your outdoor space perfectly. The Avana Padded Sling Dining Arm Chair delivers style, comfort, and exceptional value, making it an ideal choice for customers seeking upscale outdoor dining at a smart price.', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, '18.00', NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 224, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.434Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.673Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Avana","weight_lbs":"18","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Avana_Retail_SpecSheet_2026_65192P-A-Padded-Sling-Dining-Arm-Chair.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","avana","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5179, 'Avana Sling Dining Arm Chair', 'owlee-avana-sling-dining-arm-chair-65192-a', '65192-A', 'The O.W. Lee Avana Sling Dining Arm Chair combines modern elegance with everyday practicality, making it a standout choice for contemporary outdoor dining. Its clean lines, streamlined silhouette, and supportive sling seating provide comfort and style, while the durable aluminum frame ensures long-lasting performance. This chair is ideal for customers who want high-quality, stylish outdoor furniture at a more approachable price point. Quality & Customization Crafted with O.W. Lee’s renowned attention to detail, the frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, giving you peace of mind alongside comfort. With 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 durable sling fabrics, the Avana Sling Dining Arm Chair can be easily customized to fit any outdoor style. It’s the perfect blend of contemporary design, reliable craftsmanship, and accessible luxury for outdoor living.', 'The O.W. Lee Avana Sling Dining Arm Chair combines modern elegance with everyday practicality, making it a standout choice for contemporary outdoor dining. Its clean lines, streamlined silhouette, and supportive sling seating provide comfort and style, while the durable aluminum frame ensures long-lasting performance. This chair is ideal for customers who want high-quality, stylish outdoor furniture at a more approachable price point. Quality & Customization Crafted with O.W. Lee’s renowned attention to detail, the frame is backed by a 20-year structural warranty, and the finish is guaranteed for 5 years against fading, blistering, and peeling. Cushions and fabrics are also covered for 5 years, giving you peace of mind alongside comfort. With 10 elegant frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, including 16 durable sling fabrics, the Avana Sling