(5188, 'Horizon Lounge Chair', 'owlee-horizon-horizon-lounge-chair-62109-cc', '62109-CC', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Lounge Chair blends mid-century modern style with comfortable, tailored cushions and a sleek, durable aluminum frame. Ideal for relaxing or entertaining outdoors, it brings architectural sophistication to any patio or deck. Built to last with O.W. Lee craftsmanship, frames are backed by a 20-year structural warranty, finishes by a 5-year no-fade guarantee, and cushions and fabrics by a 5-year warranty. Fully customizable with 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabrics, this lounge chair delivers high-quality, long-lasting style at an affordable price.', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Lounge Chair blends mid-century modern style with comfortable, tailored cushions and a sleek, durable aluminum frame. Ideal for relaxing or entertaining outdoors, it brings architectural sophistication to any patio or deck. Built to last with O.W. Lee craftsmanship, frames are backed by a 20-year structural warranty, finishes by a 5-year no-fade guarantee, and cushions and fabrics by a 5-year warranty. Fully customizable with 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabrics, this lounge chair delivers high-quality, long-lasting style at an affordable price.', 13, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, '65.00', NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 234, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.484Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.737Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Horizon","weight_lbs":"65","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Horizon_Retail_SpecSheet_2026_Horizon-Lounge-Chair.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","horizon","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5189, 'Horizon Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair', 'owlee-horizon-horizon-swivel-rocker-lounge-chair-62109-sr', '62109-SR', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair combines mid-century modern style with effortless relaxation. Its smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion make it ideal for lounging outdoors, while the sleek, geometric aluminum frame adds architectural sophistication. Tailored, weather-resistant cushions provide lasting comfort, making this chair both stylish and functional. Part of the Horizon Collection, inspired by iconic mid-century silhouettes, this versatile line includes lounge chairs, a love seat, sofa, ottoman, and matching tables. O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship ensures lasting quality, with a 20-year structural warranty on frames, a 5-year guarantee on finishes, and a 5-year warranty on cushions and fabrics. With 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, this chair can be fully customized to suit any style, offering high-quality, long-lasting outdoor furniture at an affordable price point.', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Swivel Rocker Lounge Chair combines mid-century modern style with effortless relaxation. Its smooth swivel and gentle rocking motion make it ideal for lounging outdoors, while the sleek, geometric aluminum frame adds architectural sophistication. Tailored, weather-resistant cushions provide lasting comfort, making this chair both stylish and functional. Part of the Horizon Collection, inspired by iconic mid-century silhouettes, this versatile line includes lounge chairs, a love seat, sofa, ottoman, and matching tables. O.W. Lee’s legendary craftsmanship ensures lasting quality, with a 20-year structural warranty on frames, a 5-year guarantee on finishes, and a 5-year warranty on cushions and fabrics. With 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabric options, this chair can be fully customized to suit any style, offering high-quality, long-lasting outdoor furniture at an affordable price point.', 13, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, '69.00', NU