(5190, 'Horizon Love Seat', 'owlee-horizon-horizon-love-seat-62109-2s', '62109-2S', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Love Seat combines mid-century modern design with deep, supportive cushions and a bold, weather-resistant aluminum frame. Ideal for smaller patios or as part of a larger outdoor seating area, it delivers both comfort and lasting durability. Part of the Horizon Collection, this high-quality, long-lasting love seat is fully customizable with 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabrics—bringing stylish, durable outdoor furniture at an affordable price.', 'The O.W. Lee Horizon Love Seat combines mid-century modern design with deep, supportive cushions and a bold, weather-resistant aluminum frame. Ideal for smaller patios or as part of a larger outdoor seating area, it delivers both comfort and lasting durability. Part of the Horizon Collection, this high-quality, long-lasting love seat is fully customizable with 10 frame finishes and over 100 fabrics—bringing stylish, durable outdoor furniture at an affordable price.', 13, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, '105.00', NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 236, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.503Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.747Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Horizon","weight_lbs":"105"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","horizon","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
