(5229, 'Phoenix 31" x 56" Occasional Height Phoenix Fire Pit', 'owlee-phoenix-31-x-56-occasional-height-phoenix-fire-pit-5113-3156o-ph', '5113-3156O-PH', 'The Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold, modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its superior resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Sophisticated and sleek, Phoenix is the perfect fusion of innovation, elegance, and enduring craftsmanship. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Phoenix Fire Pit offers exceptional customization to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. Available in two heights and two versatile sizes, the Phoenix fire pit makes a striking centerpiece for any outdoor living space.', 'The Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold, modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its superior resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Sophisticated and sleek, Phoenix is the perfect fusion of innovation, elegance, and enduring craftsmanship. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Phoenix Fire Pit offers exceptional customization to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. Available in two heights and two versatile sizes, the Phoenix fire pit makes a striking centerpiece for any outdoor living space.', 13, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 275, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.963Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.177Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Phoenix","weight_lbs":"150 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Fire-Pits_Retail_SpecSheet_2026_5113-3156O-Phoenix-Occ.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","phoenix","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5230, 'Basso 36" Rd. Chat Height Basso Fire Pit', 'owlee-basso-36-rd-chat-height-basso-fire-pit-5150-36rdc', '5150-36RDC', 'Sleek, grounded, and effortlessly modern, the Basso Fire Pit by O.W. Lee brings a bold architectural presence to contemporary outdoor spaces. Its minimalist, sculptural design features a wide, shallow aluminum bowl with a softly rounded rim that appears to float above a tapered pedestal base. The contrast between the expansive top and narrow foundation creates a clean, balanced silhouette that feels intentional and refined, making Basso a striking focal point without overwhelming its surroundings. Crafted in the USA from premium outdoor-rated aluminum, the Basso Fire Pit is built for long-lasting performance and enduring style. The smooth metal surface and your choice of finish enhance its modern aesthetic, while your choice of fire media adds subtle texture and visual depth when lit. Available in 10 sophisticated finishes, Basso complements a wide range of contemporary patios, poolside lounges, rooftop terraces, and urban outdoor environments. Designed with both form and function in mind, Basso offers a choice of manual or electronic ignition. Each unit ships propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. Thoughtfully engineered and beautifully executed, the Basso Fire Pit delivers warmth, ambiance, and sculptural elegance--serving as both a functional fire feature and a modern outdoor statement piece.', 'Sleek, grounded, and effortlessly modern, the Basso Fire Pit by O.W. Lee brings a bold architectural presence to contemporary outdoor spaces. Its minimalist, sculptural design features a wide, shallow aluminum bowl with a softly rounded rim that appears to float above a tapered pedestal base. The contrast between the expansive top and narrow foundation creates a clean, balanced silhouette that feels intentional and refined, making Basso a striking focal point without overwhelming its surroundings. Crafted in the USA from premium outdoor-rated aluminum, the Basso Fire Pit is built for long-lasting performance and enduring style. The smooth metal surface and your choice of finish enhance its modern aesthetic, while your choice of fire media adds subtle texture and visual depth when lit. Available in 10 sophisticated finishes, Basso complements a wide range of contemporary patios, poolside lounges, rooftop terraces, and urban outdoor environments. Designed with both form and function in mind, Basso offers a choice of manual or electronic ignition. Each unit ships propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. Thoughtfully engineered and beautifully executed, the Basso Fire Pit delivers warmth, ambiance, and sculptural elegance--serving as both a functional fire feature and a modern outdoor statement piece.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 276, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:09.968Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.182Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Basso","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_Basso.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","basso","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5231, 'Volante 42" Rd. Chat Height Volante Aluminum Fire Pit', 'owlee-volante-42-rd-chat-height-volante-aluminum-fire-pit-5113-42rdc-vo', '5113-42RDC-VO', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 277, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:10.150Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.311Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Volante","weight_lbs":"135 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_5123-42RDC-Volante.pdf"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","volante","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
