(5233, 'Table Tops 31x56" Dekton Table Top', 'owlee-table-tops-31x56-dekton-table-top-k-3156', 'K-3156', 'The 31x56" top pairs with of our 05 table bases and is available with an umbrella hole. Elevate your outdoor or indoor dining experience with our premium Dekton table tops. Engineered from ultra-compact surfaces, Dekton combines the beauty of natural stone with exceptional performance, offering unmatched durability and elegance. Resistant to scratches, heat, stains, and UV fading, these surfaces maintain their pristine appearance even in the most demanding environments. With a sleek, modern finish and a wide palette of colors and patterns, a Dekton table top is as visually stunning as it is functional--perfect for entertaining, dining, or creating a striking centerpiece in any space.', 'The 31x56" top pairs with of our 05 table bases and is available with an umbrella hole. Elevate your outdoor or indoor dining experience with our premium Dekton table tops. Engineered from ultra-compact surfaces, Dekton combines the beauty of natural stone with exceptional performance, offering unmatched durability and elegance. Resistant to scratches, heat, stains, and UV fading, these surfaces maintain their pristine appearance even in the most demanding environments. With a sleek, modern finish and a wide palette of colors and patterns, a Dekton table top is as visually stunning as it is functional--perfect for entertaining, dining, or creating a striking centerpiece in any space.', 13, 44, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 279, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:10.165Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.327Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Table Tops"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","table-tops","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
