(5238, 'Table Tops 24" Round Micro Mesh Top', 'owlee-table-tops-24-round-micro-mesh-top-mm-24rd', 'MM-24RD', 'This 24" round table top is designed to pair with our 01 table bases. Our Micro Mesh table tops offer a light, durable, and effortlessly functional surface for outdoor living. Crafted from sturdy metal mesh, they allow air and water to pass through easily, helping surfaces dry quickly and stay cooler in the sun. The finely woven pattern adds subtle texture and visual interest while maintaining a clean, understated appearance. Engineered for long-lasting performance, Micro Mesh table tops are resistant to rust, corrosion, and everyday wear, making them ideal for both residential patios and high-traffic commercial settings. Versatile and low-maintenance, they pair beautifully with a variety of table bases and seating styles, delivering practical comfort with enduring style.', 'This 24" round table top is designed to pair with our 01 table bases. Our Micro Mesh table tops offer a light, durable, and effortlessly functional surface for outdoor living. Crafted from sturdy metal mesh, they allow air and water to pass through easily, helping surfaces dry quickly and stay cooler in the sun. The finely woven pattern adds subtle texture and visual interest while maintaining a clean, understated appearance. Engineered for long-lasting performance, Micro Mesh table tops are resistant to rust, corrosion, and everyday wear, making them ideal for both residential patios and high-traffic commercial settings. Versatile and low-maintenance, they pair beautifully with a variety of table bases and seating styles, delivering practical comfort with enduring style.', 13, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 284, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:10.195Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.351Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Table Tops"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","table-tops","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
