(5245, 'Table Bases Parsons 07 Table Base', 'owlee-table-bases-parsons-07-table-base-pa-dt07', 'PA-DT07', 'The Parsons table base delivers a bold yet understated presence, defined by clean lines and a simple modern aesthetic. Crafted from high-quality durable aluminum and paired with a substantial Dekton® top, this large-scale table is ideal for entertaining and gathering outdoors. Its impressive weight and solid construction provide exceptional stability and long-lasting performance, ensuring it’s built to endure season after season while serving as a timeless centerpiece for any outdoor dining space. This base fits the following top: - 42x84" (Dekton only)', 'The Parsons table base delivers a bold yet understated presence, defined by clean lines and a simple modern aesthetic. Crafted from high-quality durable aluminum and paired with a substantial Dekton® top, this large-scale table is ideal for entertaining and gathering outdoors. Its impressive weight and solid construction provide exceptional stability and long-lasting performance, ensuring it’s built to endure season after season while serving as a timeless centerpiece for any outdoor dining space. This base fits the following top: - 42x84" (Dekton only)', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 291, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:10.460Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.666Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Table Bases"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","table-bases","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5246, 'Table Bases Modern Aluminum 10 Dining Table Base', 'owlee-table-bases-table-bases-modern-aluminum-10-dining-table-base-table-bases-modern-aluminum-10-dining-table-base', 'Table_Bases_Modern_Aluminum_10_Dining_Table_Base', 'Sleek, minimal, and designed for contemporary outdoor living, our Modern Aluminum table bases provide a clean foundation for any table top. Crafted from durable, powder-coated aluminum, they are lightweight yet built to withstand the elements--resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Their streamlined design pairs effortlessly with porcelain, Dekton, or micro mesh tops and complements our Arc, Aris, Avana, and Studio collections, making them a versatile choice for both residential and commercial settings. Combining modern style with long-lasting performance, these bases are as practical as they are elegant.
