(3239, 'Hixon Lounge Chair', 'hixon-lounge-chair-nc', 'NC6300C-TAN', 'Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor patio lounge chair

<p>Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor patio lounge chair today!</p>

<ul>
  <li>Tangent PolyTuf™ Arms</li>
  <li>100% Post Consumer Recycled HDPE Resin</li>
  <li>Impenetrable surface: no water absorption so mold, mildew and bugs cannot penetrate the surface.</li>
  <li>Resistant to UV and harsh weather climates.</li>
  <li>Easy to clean, using soap and warm to hot water.</li>
  <li>No splintering, cracking or warping as one would find with wood.</li>
  <li>Greater impact resistance than wood.</li>
  <li>Resistant to most chemical exposures.</li>
  <li>Frame Material: Metal</li>
  <li>Cushions Included: Yes</li>
  <li>Adult Assembly Required: Yes</li>
  <li>Weight Capacity: 300 lbs.</li>
  <li>Natural Wood Grain Color Variation (No item has the same grain color, finish, or wood knots due to natural factors.)</li>
  <li>Cush270/271</li>
  <li>Seat Size: 25″ x 25″</li>
  <li>Seat height without cushion: 10.6″</li>
  <li>Cushion Thickness: 6″</li>
  <li>Seat Back Height: 18.5″</li>
  <li>Cushion Attachment Type: None</li>
  <li>Zipper Cushion Closure</li>
</ul>', 'Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor patio lounge chair', 17, 43, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:32:59.545Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:25.313Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Hixon","Mixed Media","Deep Seating & Lounge"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
