(3259, 'Seaside Teak Chair', 'seaside-teak-chair-nc', 'NC2170C', 'Patio Chair with Sunbrella Cushions features artisan craftsmanship in 100% solid, plantation-grown teak. The naturally weather-resistant teak is smoothly sanded and may be oiled to preserve the warm look as shown, or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster. Also included are cushions covered in fade and mildew-resistant sunbrella® fabric.

<p>Patio Chair with Sunbrella Cushions features artisan craftsmanship in 100% solid, plantation-grown teak. The naturally weather-resistant teak is smoothly sanded and may be oiled to preserve the warm look as shown, or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster. Also included are cushions covered in fade and mildew-resistant sunbrella® fabric.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Plush bull nose cushions in the sunbrella fabric provide unmatched fade, moisture and mildew resistance</li>
  <li>Responsibly harvested solid plantation-grown teak. The teak plantation participates in a replenished forestry program and plants 1 tree for each tree that is harvested.</li>
  <li>You may choose to allow your natural wood/teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for natural teak twice a year to preserve the natural wood/teak’s golden finish.</li>
  <li>Frame Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Cushions Included: Yes</li>
  <li>Product Care: Easily clean cushions with mild soap and water for an enduringly pristine surface. Air dry only.</li>
  <li>Assembly Required: Yes</li>
  <li>Seat Cushion Thickness 6”</li>
  <li>Seat Height Without Cushion 12”</li>
  <li>Weight Capacity: 300 lbs.</li>
</ul>', 'Patio Chair with Sunbrella Cushions features artisan craftsmanship in 100% solid, plantation-grown teak. The naturally weather-resistant teak is smoothly sanded and may be oiled to preserve the warm look as shown, or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster. Also included are cushions covered in fade and mildew-resistant sunbrella® fabric.', 17, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:06.355Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:25.788Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Seaside","Teak","Deep Seating & Lounge"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
