(3268, 'Solano 2 Seater Dining Bench', 'solano-2-seater-dining-bench-nc', 'NC2045-DLS', 'This teak patio bench loveseat with arms is great for dining tables and sitting outside on its own. This naturally weather-resistant hardwood may be maintained to preserve the warm look as shown or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Plantation-grown teak.

