  <li>Luxurious look and texture.</li>
  <li>Duraboard® tabletop – treated with a UV-coating process which makes it highly resistant to scratches and weather conditions.</li>
</ul>', 'Features: About the Duraboard® tabletop: Built to last a lifetime, Duraboard® – an innovative material for outdoor tabletops like no other on the market – is an environmentally friendly material that is durable, highly UV-resistant and has a unique surface finish. It features two main components, eucalyptus FSC™ sawdust and polyethylene resin, extruded to create a strong, durable structure. The tabletop is treated with a UV-coating process, receiving a multi-layer coating which makes it highly resistant to scratches and weather conditions.', 17, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:22.251Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:25.905Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Chalfonte","Mixed Media","Dining Tables"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(3290, 'Hixon Slat Dining Table With 4 Legs – Polytuf Top', 'hixon-slat-dining-table-with-4-legs-polytuf-top-nc', 'NC6791CVT-REC-TAN', 'Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor patio dining table

<p>Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor patio dining table today!</p>

