(3298, 'Anderson 87/118″ Extension Dining Table', 'anderson-87-118-extension-dining-table-nc', 'NC2010-DT-87', 'This teak extension dining table is the perfect size to seat up to 10 adults around. This naturally weather-resistant hardwood may be maintained to preserve the warm look as shown or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Plantation-grown teak.

<p>This teak extension dining table is the perfect size to seat up to 10 adults around. This naturally weather-resistant hardwood may be maintained to preserve the warm look as shown or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Plantation-grown teak.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Hardware is zinc-coated steel that has been plated in brass. The zinc helps minimize corrosion, steel was chosen for strength and brass for its luster.</li>
  <li>You may choose to allow your teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for teak twice a year to preserve the natural wood/teak’s rustic finish</li>
  <li>Plantation-grown teak is harvested from mature trees that are part of a replenished forestry program</li>
  <li>Base Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Top Color: Light Yellow</li>
  <li>Base Color: Light Yellow</li>
  <li>Seating Capacity When Fully Extended: 8</li>
  <li>Seating Capacity When Fully Collapsed: 10</li>
  <li>Table Mechanism: Drop Leaf</li>
  <li>Leaf Width Side to Side: 41″</li>
  <li>Leaf Length End to End: 31″</li>
  <li>Length when fully collapsed: 87″</li>
  <li>Length when fully extended: 118″</li>
  <li>Assembly Required: Yes</li>
  <li>Top Material: Teak</li>
  <li>Top Material Details: Plantation-grown teak</li>
</ul>', 'This teak extension dining table is the perfect size to seat up to 10 adults around. This naturally weather-resistant hardwood may be maintained to preserve the warm look as shown or allowed to weather naturally to a beautiful silvery gray patina. Plantation-grown teak.', 17, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:23.640Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:25.806Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Universal Teak","Teak","Dining Tables"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
