(3333, 'Laguna Teak Rectangle Coffee Table', 'laguna-teak-rectangle-coffee-table-nc', 'NC2015CT', 'The Laguna Coffee Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna

<p>The Laguna Coffee Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna collection.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Our Plantation Teak products are plantation-grown and harvested from mature trees that are 50-60 years old.</li>
  <li>Our Plantation Teak is oven- or air-dried for moisture control</li>
  <li>This line of teak is part of a replenished forestry program, where a new tree is planted for each one that is harvested</li>
  <li>A wire wheel is used to distress the reclaimed wood to enhance the grain and provide a rustic finish.</li>
  <li>Grade B Teak.</li>
  <li>You may choose to allow your natural teak to weather to a beautiful silver-gray patina or treat it with an oil or sealer specifically made for natural teak twice a year to preserve the natural wood/teak’s golden finish.</li>
  <li>Natural teak may be cleaned using a wood cleaner, or lightly sanded with 600 (or higher) grit sandpaper.</li>
  <li>Leave your natural teak products outside year-round (under a furniture cover when not in use) or store in a COOL, DRY place during the winter to preserve the teak’s moisture.</li>
</ul>', 'The Laguna Coffee Table is 100% solid, plantation grown teak. Whether allowed to weather or maintained to keep it’s natural, warm golden look, it will be a striking addition to your patio setting. It is designed to match the entire Laguna', 17, 46, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-05-30T23:33:33.396Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-09T22:52:37.657Z'::timestamptz, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["Laguna","Teak","Accent Tables"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
