(3356, 'Hixon Ottoman', 'hixon-ottoman-nc', 'NC6300O-TAN', 'Modern Style with Unmatched Versatility. A mixture of Tangent PolyTuf™ Lumber and a powered coated aluminum frame makes this the perfect combination for a modern look with an elegant style. Take home this outdoor ottoman

