(3365, 'Rio Chaise Lounge', 'rio-chaise-lounge-nc', 'NC6870-SACL', 'This sling Chaise Lounge offers clean lines with mixed-media style. It features ash gray outdoor upholstery that combines with a stylish sterling gray finish on the frame and legs. The upholstery material is designed to withstand the elements while providing a surprisingly comfortable seat.

