(3949, 'Armless Adjustable Chaise', 'armless-adjustable-chaise-blair-homecrest', '10301', 'Armless Adjustable Chaise — Homecrest Blair collection.

<p>Uniquely transitional and highly functional, Homecrest’s Elements sling collection is an industry favorite. Subtle curves and clean angles combine to create a collection that can be artfully classic or freshly modern, depending on your design sensibilities and your outdoor space. Available in low back, high back, and balcony seating, Elements has the added versatility of complementing a wide range of deep seating styles with ease. Elements comes in low back, high back, balcony options, and more. This, in combination with its adaptable style, makes it highly suitable for homeowners who value versatility, as well as commercial environments such as hotel lounges, rooftop bars, and beyond.</p>', 'Armless Adjustable Chaise — Homecrest Blair collection.', 16, 42, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:33.164Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.740Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Width":"24\"","Height":"43.5\"","Length":"82.5\"","Weight":"24.6 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Seat Height":"16\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
