(3967, '35.5 " x 23" End Table/Corner Unit', '35-5-x-23-mode-end-table-corner-unit-blair-air-homecrest', '1310020', '35.5" x 23" Mode End Table/Corner Unit — Homecrest Blair Air collection.

<p>Add an element of sophistication to your outdoor space with Homecrest''s Mode collection. With clean lines and contemporary inspiration, Mode sets the standard in casual chic. Mode features floating aluminum rectangular panels and a sleek appearance that brings an elegant style to your outdoor space. The aluminum top panels that float over the base frame are available in all finishes. DuoTone your Mode table or fire table by selecting one color for the top panels and a coordinating color for the base.</p>', '35.5" x 23" Mode End Table/Corner Unit — Homecrest Blair Air collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:35.998Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.716Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Aluminum"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(3968, 'Armless Center Chat Chair', 'armless-center-chat-chair-blair-cushion-homecrest', '8439N-DC', 'Armless Center Chat Chair — Homecrest Blair Cushion collection.

<p>Elevate your outdoor seating experience with our Blair collection. Blair redefines relaxation with its plush cushions and sleek metal back design features. The 8” cushions featuring DreamCore technology mean you can sink into a soft seat, enveloped in comfort. Crafted with precision and durability in mind, Blair''s all-aluminum frame ensures longevity and stability for years to come. Designed for versatility, Blair offers a variety of modular pieces that allow for unlimited configurations, creating arrangements tailored to your unique needs. Note: This is not a standalone piece.</p>', 'Armless Center Chat Chair — Homecrest Blair Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:36.143Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.550Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"33\"","Width":"24\"","Height":"35\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Seat Height":"18\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
