(3993, 'Chat Chair', 'chat-chair-boden-cushion-homecrest', '4239A', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Boden Cushion collection.

<p>The Boden collection’s clean, architectural lines and tubular frame offer a bold, modern silhouette. Its seamless curves and integrated armrests create a sense of flow, while the plush, High Resilient cushions invite you to sit back and breathe deep. Boden’s sleek lines and contemporary appeal are matched by exceptional durability and weather resistance. Crafted with powder-coated aluminum and all-weather cushions, Boden is made to withstand the elements while offering luxurious comfort season after season.</p>', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Boden Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:40.148Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:23.643Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"35.8\"","Width":"32.5\"","Height":"33.4\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Arm Height":"24.4\"","Seat Height":"19\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
