<p>Boden   Collection The Boden cushion collection blends bold, modern design with seamless curves and plush comfort, offering durable, weather-resistant luxury for outdoor living. Fog Finish The Fog frame finish blends the soothing neutrality of gray with warm taupe undertones, creating a versatile shade that complements both modern and classic styles. Surf Collection The Surf collection combines nature-inspired design with durable all-weather poly and aluminum materials, making it a stylish and practical choice for high-traffic outdoor spaces. Medley Collection The Medley collection offers the look of natural wood with the durability of powder-coated aluminum and all-weather poly creating a stylish, low-maintenance solution for outdoor dining.</p>', 'Removable Seat Pad (with Ties) — Homecrest Echo collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:42.811Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.242Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Steel"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
