(4084, 'Armless Lounge Chair', 'armless-lounge-chair-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL22104', 'Armless Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>From children to adults, our In-Pool Series armless lounge chair comfortably seats people of any age and size. Designed with a smaller footprint so you can maximize your space, the armless lounge chair stays in place in up to 11” of water. It features a hole at the bottom of each leg so water can enter and exit the core with ease. Alternatively, an optional pump can be purchased for the convenience of a pump-fill system. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Armless Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.023Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.000Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4085, 'Lounge Chair', 'lounge-chair-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL22102', 'Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Indulge in our captivating In-Pool Series lounge chair, a simple yet bold fusion of art and comfort. Crafted to provide refined leisure, this chair sits low and relaxed. The lounge chair features fluid, curved lines that give it an artistic appeal, allowing it to complement a range of exterior styles from modern to eclectic. With a maximum water depth of 12”, the lounge chair features an open bottom for effortless arrangements in or out of the pool. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.160Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.003Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4086, 'Chat Chair', 'chat-chair-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL22103', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Our In-Pool Series chat chair combines a playful design and vibrant colors to make it the perfect addition to gatherings, adding a modern touch to your everyday outdoor relaxation. It is a popular option for hotels and larger pools, and it is specifically engineered to withstand the rigors of poolside environments. The chat chair typically works in water up to 12”, but with the addition of optional weights, this depth can increase up to 16”. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.287Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.006Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4087, 'High Back Lounge Chair', 'high-back-lounge-chair-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPLWOOSAH', 'High Back Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Take a deep breath, sit back, and relax as you feel your tension wash away in our In-Pool Series high back lounge chair. It has a standard “Adirondack” seat height for optimal comfort in the pool or on the patio. This chair will resist movement from light waves and wind in up to 13” of water. For use in deeper water, you may add coated diving weights to the base. Two 4-pound weights will allow the high back lounge chair to stay put in up to 18” of water. Note: We’ve tested this chair up to 18" water depths when using two 4 lb coated weights (8 lbs total). Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'High Back Lounge Chair — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.417Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.009Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4088, 'Armless Lounger', 'armless-lounger-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL44100NR', 'Armless Lounger — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>All In-Pool products are available in a variety of colors and are suitable for use in both chlorinated and saltwater pools, as well as on all pool materials like concrete, vinyl liners, and gunite. They can be easily removed from the pool to be used on the pool deck. Each product has a recommended maximum water depth for best performance.</p>', 'Armless Lounger — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.542Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.013Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4089, 'Armless Lounger with 4" Riser', 'armless-lounger-with-4-riser-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL44100W4R', 'Armless Lounger with 4" Riser — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>All In-Pool products are available in a variety of colors and are suitable for use in both chlorinated and saltwater pools, as well as on all pool materials like concrete, vinyl liners, and gunite. They can be easily removed from the pool to be used on the pool deck. Each product has a recommended maximum water depth for best performance.</p>', 'Armless Lounger with 4" Riser — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.771Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.017Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4090, 'Lounger (2 Pack)', 'lounger-2-pack-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL33100', 'Lounger (2 Pack) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

<p>Experience the ultimate in modern style, comfort, and luxury with our In-Pool Series lounger. This innovative lounger works in up to 5” of water and will transform your poolside relaxation time. It features an ergonomic design for all to enjoy and comes with an optional head pillow for added comfort. This lounger is designed to be compatible with various types of pools, and its smooth surface and rounded edges prevent harm to delicate surfaces. Available in Desert Sandstone*, Gray Granite*, Light Blue*, River Rock*, Surf Blue*, White*, White Granite, and Yellow* color options. *This color incurs a longer lead time of six weeks.</p>', 'Lounger (2 Pack) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:54.913Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.022Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4091, 'Lounger with 4" Riser (2 Pack)', 'lounger-with-4-riser-2-pack-in-pool-series-homecrest', 'SPL33100W4R', 'Lounger with 4" Riser (2 Pack) — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.

