<p>Need to store or transport your In-Pool Series portable seat pads? Designed to make your life easier, the portable seat pad caddy can hold up to 10 portable seat pads, making it the perfect storage and transport solution. Finished in a sleek powder coated matte black, featuring a gently curved top handle, you can effortlessly carry your portable seat pads from one location to the next.</p>', 'Portable Seat Pad Caddy — Homecrest In-Pool Series collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:57.151Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.171Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Material":"Polyethylene"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
