(4109, 'Low Back Dining Chair', 'low-back-dining-chair-kashton-homecrest', '1K680', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Kashton collection.

<p>Our Kashton collection is a treat for the eyes with its sleek, nearly aerodynamic frame design. Its full aluminum frame features arms that round at the front and trail at the back like a slipstream, evoking a sense of motion. In this way, Kashton is the perfect collection to add vibrant flair to any outdoor environment. This stationary, but dynamic, collection comes in dining, balcony, swivel rocker, and chaise seating styles. Because of this, Kashton lends itself to homeowners who value versatility, as well as a wide variety of design applications including fine dining, luxury resorts, poolside, and more.</p>', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Kashton collection.', 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:57.418Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.178Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"30\"","Width":"25\"","Height":"37\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Arm Height":"26.25\"","Seat Height":"19.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
