(4115, 'Chat Chair', 'chat-chair-liberty-cushion-homecrest', '1639A', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Liberty Cushion collection.

<p>Liberty’s timeless design and unparalleled comfort from DreamCore™ cushions will enhance outdoor spaces for generations to come. Create an environment of relaxation and serenity with a full complement of deep seating pieces, all made in the USA. The crisp tailoring and clean lines will create an engaging ambiance that celebrates the past and the future. This collection is sure to make any outdoor space stylish and inviting. Liberty lends itself to environments where relaxation and connection are priorities. Its chat chair, swivel rockers, and more make it perfect for homeowners who crave comfort, as well as lounges in anywhere from luxury resort to multi-family living environments.</p>', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Liberty Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:36:58.233Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.204Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"35\"","Width":"28\"","Height":"42\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Arm Height":"24\"","Seat Height":"18\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
