(4141, 'Chat Chair', 'chat-chair-revive-cushion-homecrest', '6139A-DC', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Revive Cushion collection.

<p>Homecrest’s Revive cushion collection celebrates mid-century modern design, and the artists of all kinds who shaped a generation. It is sure to bring a subtle sophistication to any outdoor space through its curated design inspiration. Featuring our signature DreamCore™ cushion technology, Revive cushion offers supreme comfort to complement its bold visual aesthetic. With all of the industry-leading, quality specifications that Homecrest consistently delivers, Revive cushion celebrates a dynamic era with the promise that it will be enjoyed by generations to come. This collection comes in chat, swivel rocker, loveseat, and sofa seating styles, making it ideal for environments where relaxation is at the forefront.</p>', 'Chat Chair — Homecrest Revive Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:02.098Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.303Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"34\"","Width":"30.5\"","Height":"35\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Arm Height":"25\"","Seat Height":"18\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
