(4155, 'Club Chair', 'club-chair-rowan-cushion-homecrest', '96380', 'Club Chair — Homecrest Rowan Cushion collection.

<p>The Rowan collection combines a sleek, powder-coated aluminum frame with woven, weather-resistant rope to create a modern and sophisticated aesthetic. Crafted with quick-dry foam cushions and premium outdoor fabric, Rowan is designed for ultimate convenience, comfort, and resilience. From corporate spaces to apartment amenity decks, Rowan’s design suits any setting.</p>', 'Club Chair — Homecrest Rowan Cushion collection.', 16, 43, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:04.254Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.348Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"32.7\"","Width":"40.2\"","Height":"30\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Rope + Aluminum","Arm Height":"26.4\"","Seat Height":"18\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
