(4165, 'Low Back Dining Chair', 'low-back-dining-chair-sutton-homecrest', '45680', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Sutton collection.

<p>The Sutton sling collection offers the refined comfort of Homecrest''s signature double layer sling, perfect for al fresco dining or lounging. Sutton''s geometric frame design contrasts with the gently curving sling seat to give outdoor spaces a refined, but energizing, aesthetic. The durable all-aluminum frame can be augmented with an add-on Wind Kit to add weight for windy environments.</p>', 'Low Back Dining Chair — Homecrest Sutton collection.', 16, 44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:05.715Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:24.380Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Depth":"30\"","Width":"24.75\"","Height":"37\"","Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Aluminum","Arm Height":"25.625\"","Seat Height":"19.5\""}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
