(4400, '42" Lounge Fire Table', '42-lounge-fire-table-concrete-fire-tables-homecrest', '42SQCTTT', '42" Lounge Fire Table — Homecrest Concrete Fire Tables collection.

<p>This is the perfect top for achieving a modern, industrial look. Our Concrete tops are a part of our Natural Series collection, which brings a sophisticated organic design element to outdoor spaces utilizing the latest in composite technology. Homecrest fire tables feature powerful burners delivering up to 65,000 BTUs and are compatible with both natural gas and liquid propane. Each table includes a concealed fuel tank and comes standard with your choice of fire jewelry, a secure key, and a black 3/4" aluminum fire burner riser.</p>', '42" Lounge Fire Table — Homecrest Concrete Fire Tables collection.', 16, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-01T06:37:49.696Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-08T21:38:25.180Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"Weight":"0 lbs","Material":"Natural Series"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '[]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
