(4887, 'Anello 42" Round Chat Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-anello-42-round-chat-height-fire-pit-5162-42rdc', '5162-42RDC', 'Introducing the aluminum Anello Fire Pit by O.W. Lee, where clean design meets timeless sophistication. Featuring a sleek cylindrical aluminum base and an artisan-crafted porcelain tile top, Anello delivers a refined, minimalist aesthetic with lightweight durability ideal for outdoor environments. Built in the USA with O.W. Lee’s renowned attention to detail, Anello blends standout aluminum design with everyday performance. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. With 10 premium aluminum frame finishes and sixteen porcelain tile options, Anello adds a polished modern touch to any outdoor space.', 'Introducing the aluminum Anello Fire Pit by O.W. Lee, where clean design meets timeless sophistication. Featuring a sleek cylindrical aluminum base and an artisan-crafted porcelain tile top, Anello delivers a refined, minimalist aesthetic with lightweight durability ideal for outdoor environments. Built in the USA with O.W. Lee’s renowned attention to detail, Anello blends standout aluminum design with everyday performance. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. With 10 premium aluminum frame finishes and sixteen porcelain tile options, Anello adds a polished modern touch to any outdoor space.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, '145.00', 'H 24" × W 42" × D 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 0, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:48.273Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.273Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Anello","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/casual-fireside/anello-42-round-chat-height-fire-pit/","weight_lbs":"145","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_Anello.pdf","depth_length_in":"42","width_diameter_in":"42"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","anello","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4888, '42" Rd. Occasional Height Santorini Aluminum Fire Pit', 'owlee-42-rd-occasional-height-santorini-aluminum-fire-pit-5110-rdo', '5110-RDO', 'Inspired by the timeless beauty of Mediterranean architecture, the iron Santorini Fire Pit blends old-world charm with modern durability, creating a striking focal point for evening gatherings or serene solo moments. Its fully welded iron construction provides exceptional strength and stability while delivering a refined, architectural presence outdoors. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Santorini Fire Pit allows you to tailor every detail to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant iron frame finishes and sixteen striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With two height options and six versatile sizes, Santorini adapts beautifully to any space or style.', 'Inspired by the timeless beauty of Mediterranean architecture, the iron Santorini Fire Pit blends old-world charm with modern durability, creating a striking focal point for evening gatherings or serene solo moments. Its fully welded iron construction provides exceptional strength and stability while delivering a refined, architectural presence outdoors. Handcrafted in the USA by skilled artisans, the Santorini Fire Pit allows you to tailor every detail to suit your outdoor aesthetic. Choose from 10 elegant iron frame finishes and sixteen striking porcelain tile tops to create your ideal centerpiece. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With two height options and six versatile sizes, Santorini adapts beautifully to any space or style.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 42" × D 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 22, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:48.8