(4891, 'Haven 42" Square Chat Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-haven-42-square-chat-height-fire-pit-5125-42sqc', '5125-42SQC', 'Introducing the Haven Fire Pit, O.W. Lee’s only square fire pit in Aluminum--a bold blend of clean lines, creative spirit, and welcoming warmth. With its sleek metal surface and gently playful proportions, Haven brings a lighthearted edge to serious craftsmanship. Designed and handcrafted in the USA, Haven features 10 premium frame finishes to suit a variety of aesthetics. Choose between manual or electronic ignition, with each model arriving propane-ready and easily convertible to natural gas using an optional kit. Its square shape makes it a versatile fit for both symmetrical layouts and more eclectic outdoor spaces—creating a fun, functional centerpiece that sparks conversation as easily as it radiates heat.', 'Introducing the Haven Fire Pit, O.W. Lee’s only square fire pit in Aluminum--a bold blend of clean lines, creative spirit, and welcoming warmth. With its sleek metal surface and gently playful proportions, Haven brings a lighthearted edge to serious craftsmanship. Designed and handcrafted in the USA, Haven features 10 premium frame finishes to suit a variety of aesthetics. Choose between manual or electronic ignition, with each model arriving propane-ready and easily convertible to natural gas using an optional kit. Its square shape makes it a versatile fit for both symmetrical layouts and more eclectic outdoor spaces—creating a fun, functional centerpiece that sparks conversation as easily as it radiates heat.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 24" × W 42" × D 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 44, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:49.375Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.279Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Haven","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/casual-fireside/haven-42-square-chat-height-fire-pit/","weight_lbs":"88 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_S