(4893, 'Nova 42" Round Chat Height Fire Pit', 'owlee-nova-42-round-chat-height-fire-pit-5163-42rdc', '5163-42RDC', 'Introducing the Nova Fire Pit by O.W. Lee—a sleek new design that pairs minimalist form with cutting-edge materials. With its smooth cylindrical base and ultra-durable Dekton® hearth top, Nova offers a refined, architectural presence that anchors any modern outdoor space. Produced in the USA with O.W. Lee’s hallmark craftsmanship, Nova is both visually striking and highly functional. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With 10 premium frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops, Nova brings a refined, minimalist aesthetic to any outdoor setting.', 'Introducing the Nova Fire Pit by O.W. Lee—a sleek new design that pairs minimalist form with cutting-edge materials. With its smooth cylindrical base and ultra-durable Dekton® hearth top, Nova offers a refined, architectural presence that anchors any modern outdoor space. Produced in the USA with O.W. Lee’s hallmark craftsmanship, Nova is both visually striking and highly functional. Available with either manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and can be easily converted to natural gas with an optional conversion kit. With 10 premium frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops, Nova brings a refined, minimalist aesthetic to any outdoor setting.', 13, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, '145.00', 'H 24" × W 42" × D 42"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 48, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:49.692Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.268Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Nova","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/casual-fireside/nova-42-round-chat-height-fire-pit/","weight_lbs":"145","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/Casual-Fireside_Retail_SpecSheets_2026_Nova.pdf","depth_length_in":"42","width_diameter_in":"42"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","nova","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4894, 'Phoenix 31x56" Chat Height Phoenix Fire Pit', 'owlee-phoenix-31x56-chat-height-phoenix-fire-pit-5113-3156c-ph', '5113-3156C-PH', 'The iron Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Its solid iron construction provides exceptional strength while anchoring the design with a refined, architectural presence. Handcrafted in the USA, Phoenix offers extensive customization with 10 elegant iron frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. Offered in two heights and two sizes, the Phoenix Fire Pit delivers sculptural beauty with long-lasting iron durability.', 'The iron Phoenix Fire Pit by O.W. Lee redefines outdoor luxury with a bold modern design and the unmatched durability of Dekton®--a premium ultra-compact surface known for its resistance to heat, scratches, and weather. Its solid iron construction provides exceptional strength while anchoring the design with a refined, architectural presence. Handcrafted in the USA, Phoenix offers extensive customization with 10 elegant iron frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit ships propane-ready and can be converted to natural gas with an optional kit. Offered in two heights and two sizes, the Phoenix Fire Pit delivers sculptural beauty with long-lasting iron durability.', 13, 45, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 24" × W 56" × D 31"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 49, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:49.842Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.161Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Phoenix","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/casual-fireside/30x50-chat-height-phoenix-fire-pit/","weight_lbs":"145 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2