(4895, '20" Round Micro Mesh Iron Side Table', 'owlee-20-round-micro-mesh-iron-side-table-51-lt20mmrd', '51-LT20MMRD', 'Compact, classic, and built for outdoor durability, the 20" Round Micro Mesh Iron Side Table offers a versatile surface with timeless appeal. Featuring a micro mesh top, it provides a lighter, breathable look while allowing water to pass through with ease. Crafted from sturdy iron, this side table is designed to withstand the elements and pair seamlessly with a wide range of seating styles. Perfect for holding drinks, décor, or everyday essentials, it’s a functional accent that brings both charm and durability to any outdoor space.', 'Compact, classic, and built for outdoor durability, the 20" Round Micro Mesh Iron Side Table offers a versatile surface with timeless appeal. Featuring a micro mesh top, it provides a lighter, breathable look while allowing water to pass through with ease. Crafted from sturdy iron, this side table is designed to withstand the elements and pair seamlessly with a wide range of seating styles. Perfect for holding drinks, décor, or everyday essentials, it’s a functional accent that brings both charm and durability to any outdoor space.', 13, 44, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 23.25" × W 20" × D 20"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 51, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:49.984Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.417Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"23.25","collection":"Pre-Designed Tables","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/fully-welded-tables/20-rd-side-table-fully-welded-tables-micro-mesh-iron-tables/","weight_lbs":"26 (pkg)","depth_length_in":"20","width_diameter_in":"20"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","tables-tops-bases","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4896, '20" Round Porcelain Tile Iron Side Table', 'owlee-20-round-porcelain-tile-iron-side-table-51-lt20rd', '51-LT20RD', 'Elegant and durable, the 20" Round Porcelain Tile Iron Side Table adds a refined touch to any outdoor setting. Featuring a porcelain tile top, it offers the beauty of natural stone with exceptional resistance to moisture, stains, heat, and fading. The sturdy iron base provides lasting strength and stability, making this side table well suited for everyday outdoor use. Perfectly sized for drinks, décor, or small essentials, it combines timeless style with dependable performance for patios, lounges, and commercial spaces.', 'Elegant and durable, the 20" Round Porcelain Tile Iron Side Table adds a refined touch to any outdoor setting. Featuring a porcelain tile top, it offers the beauty of natural stone with exceptional resistance to moisture, stains, heat, and fading. The sturdy iron base provides lasting strength and stability, making this side table well suited for everyday outdoor use. Perfectly sized for drinks, décor, or small essentials, it combines timeless style with dependable performance for patios, lounges, and commercial spaces.', 13, 44, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 24" × W 20" × D 20"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 52, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:50.245Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.439Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24","collection":"Pre-Designed Tables","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/fully-welded-tables/20-round-porcelain-tile-iron-side-table/","weight_lbs":"26 (pkg)","depth_length_in":"20","width_diameter_in":"20"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","tables-tops-bases","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4897, '20" Square Slat Top Side Table', 'owlee-20-square-slat-top-side-table-ma-2020st', 'MA-2020ST', 'Sleek, minimal, and perfectly suited for contemporary outdoor living, this 20" side table features a durable aluminum top with clean slats, creating a light, airy design. Crafted from powder-coated aluminum, it is lightweight yet built to withstand the elements--resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Its simple modern silhouette complements any outdoor seating arrangement, making it an ideal addition to patios, decks, or commercial spaces. Stylish, functional, and low-maintenance, this side table brings both elegance and practicality to your outdoor spaces.', 'Sleek, minimal, and perfectly suited for contemporary outdoor living, this 20" side table features a durable aluminum top with clean slats, creating a light, airy design. Crafted from powder-coated aluminum, it is lightweight yet built to withstand the elements--resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Its simple modern silhouette complements any outdoor seating arrangement, making it an ideal addition to patios, decks, or commercial spaces. Stylish, functional, and low-maintenance, this side table brings both elegance and practicality to your outdoor spaces.', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 20.5" × W 20" × D 20"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 53, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:50.435Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.434Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"20.5","collection":"Pre-Designed Tables","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/fully-welded-tables/20-square-slat-top-side-table/","weight_lbs":"22 (pkg)","depth_length_in":"20","width_diameter_in":"20"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","tables-tops-bases","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4898, '21" x 57" Quadra Iron Counter Table', 'owlee-21-x-57-quadra-iron-counter-table-qd-2157', 'QD-2157', 'Clean-lined and architecturally modern, the Quadra Iron Tables bring refined structure to outdoor spaces. Defined by their squared iron frame and crisp geometry, Quadra tables offer a contemporary look that feels substantial yet uncluttered. Crafted from durable iron and built to withstand the elements, these tables deliver lasting strength and stability for everyday outdoor living. Available in a wide range of sizes--including side tables, occasional tables, counter height, console, and dining--Quadra tables provide versatile solutions for everything from intimate seating areas to large entertaining spaces. Their simple, modern profile pairs seamlessly with a variety of collections, making Quadra a timeless foundation for both residential and commercial environments.', 'Clean-lined and architecturally modern, the Quadra Iron Tables bring refined structure to outdoor spaces. Defined by their squared iron frame and crisp geometry, Quadra tables offer a contemporary look that feels substantial yet uncluttered. Crafted from durable iron and built to withstand the elements, these tables deliver lasting strength and stability for everyday outdoor living. Available in a wide range of sizes--including side tables, occasional tables, counter height, console, and dining--Quadra tables provide versatile solutions for everything from intimate seating areas to large entertaining spaces. Their simple, modern profile pairs seamlessly with a variety of collections, making Quadra a timeless foundation for both residential and commercial environments.', 13, 44, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 37.5" × W 56.5" × D 20.5"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 54, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:50.579Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.394Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"37.5","collection":"Pre-Designed Tables","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/quadra-iron-tables/21-x-57-counter-table-fu