(4931, 'Kensington Square Side Table', 'owlee-kensington-square-side-table-91-st18sq', '91-ST18SQ', 'The Standard Aluminum table base offers a timeless, versatile foundation designed to complement a wide range of outdoor styles. Crafted from durable aluminum, it provides excellent strength, stability, and resistance to the elements for long-term outdoor use. Clean lines and a balanced profile make it an easy pairing with multiple tabletop shapes and materials, while its dependable construction ensures lasting performance in both residential and commercial settings. Fits table tops: - 36" Square (Porcelain) - 42" Round (Porcelain, Micro Mesh) - 42" Square (Porcelain, Micro Mesh) - 54" Round (Porcelain, Dekton, Micro Mesh)', 'The Standard Aluminum table base offers a timeless, versatile foundation designed to complement a wide range of outdoor styles. Crafted from durable aluminum, it provides excellent strength, stability, and resistance to the elements for long-term outdoor use. Clean lines and a balanced profile make it an easy pairing with multiple tabletop shapes and materials, while its dependable construction ensures lasting performance in both residential and commercial settings. Fits table tops: - 36" Square (Porcelain) - 42" Round (Porcelain, Micro Mesh) - 42" Square (Porcelain, Micro Mesh) - 54" Round (Porcelain, Dekton, Micro Mesh)', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 21" × W 18" × D 18"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 92, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:58.107Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.421Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"21","collection":"Pre-Designed Tables","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/fully-welded-tables/square-side-table-aluminum-wrought-aluminum-kensington/","weight_lbs":"37 (pkg)","depth_length_in":"18","width_diameter_in":"18"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","tables-tops-bases","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4932, 'Marin Side Table', 'owlee-marin-side-table-37-st20rd', '37-ST20RD', 'The Marin 20" Round Porcelain Tile Aluminum Side Table brings refined coastal style and everyday functionality to outdoor lounge settings. Fully welded for strength and stability, this table is designed as a complete piece. Its clean lines and balanced proportions make it an easy companion to lounge chairs, sofas, and chaises. Crafted from durable aluminum, the Marin side table resists corrosion, moisture, and weather-related wear, making it especially well suited for outdoor and coastal environments. The porcelain tile top is engineered for long-lasting performance using a three-layer construction: a porcelain surface layer that resists heat, scratches, stains, and fading; a reinforced backing layer for added strength and impact resistance; and a protective bonding layer that securely fuses the tile to the aluminum frame. This multi-layer approach ensures exceptional durability, stability, and performance in outdoor conditions. Finished in your choice of O.W. Lee’s premium finishes and with your choice of porcelain tile, this table delivers long-lasting performance with a tailored, timeless look. Best for: • Outdoor lounge and seating areas • Poolside, patio, or covered outdoor spaces • Coordinated accent tables with Marin seating Features: • Fully welded aluminum construction for long-term durability • 20" round porcelain tile top • Weather- and corrosion-resistant materials • Available in O.W. Lee’s wide range of finishes and tiles for a custom look that matches your style', 'The Marin 20" Round Porcelain Tile Aluminum Side Table brings refined coastal style and everyday functionality to outdoor lounge settings. Fully welded for strength and stability, this table is designed as a complete piece. Its clean lines and balanced proportions make it an easy companion to lounge chairs, sofas, and chaises. Crafted from durable aluminum, the Marin side table resists corrosion, moisture, and weather-related wear, making it especially well suited for outdoor and coastal environments. The porcelain tile top is engineered for long-lasting performance using a three-layer construction: a porcelain surface layer that resists heat, scratches, stains, and fading; a reinforced backing layer for added strength and impact resistance; and a protective bonding layer that securely fuses the tile to the aluminum frame. This multi-layer approach ensures exceptional durability, stability, and performance in outdoor conditions. Finished in your choice of O.W. Lee’s premium finishes and with your choice of porcelain tile, this table delivers long-lasting performance with a tailored, timeless look. Best for: • Outdoor lounge and seating areas • Poolside, patio, or covered outdoor spaces • Coordinated accent tables with Marin seating Features: • Fully welded aluminum construction for long-term durability • 20" round porcelain tile top • Weather- and corrosion-resistant materials • Available in O.W. Lee’s wide range of finishes and tiles for a custom look that matches your style', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, '25.00', 'H 24.5" × W 20" × D 20"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 97, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:58.269Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:47.861Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"24.5","collection":"Marin","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/marin/marin-side-table-table/","weight_lbs":"25","depth_length_in":"20","width_diameter_in":"20"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","tables-tops-bases","made-in-usa","quote-only"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(4933, 'Modern Aluminum 03 Bar Table Base', 'owlee-modern-aluminum-03-bar-table-base-ma-bt03', 'MA-BT03', 'Sleek, minimal, and designed for contemporary outdoor living, our Modern Aluminum table bases provide a clean foundation for any table top. Crafted from durable, powder-coated aluminum, they are lightweight yet built to withstand the elements—resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Their streamlined design pairs effortlessly with porcelain, Dekton, or micro mesh tops and complements our Arc, Aris, Avana, and Studio collections, making them a versatile choice for both residential and commercial settings. Combining modern style with long-lasting performance, these bases are as practical as they are elegant. This base fits the following tops: - 36" Square (Porcelain) - 42" Round (Porcelain and Micro Mesh) - 42" Square (Porcelain and Micro Mesh) - 54" Round (Porcelain, Dekton, and Micro Mesh)', 'Sleek, minimal, and designed for contemporary outdoor living, our Modern Aluminum table bases provide a clean foundation for any table top. Crafted from durable, powder-coated aluminum, they are lightweight yet built to withstand the elements—resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Their streamlined design pairs effortlessly with porcelain, Dekton, or micro mesh tops and complements our Arc, Aris, Avana, and Studio collections, making them a versatile choice for both residential and commercial settings. Combining modern style with long-lasting performance, these bases are as practical as they are elegant. This base fits the following tops: - 36" Square (Porcelain) - 42" Round (Porcelain and Micro Mesh) - 42" Square (Porcelain and Micro Mesh) - 54" Round (Porcelain, Dekton, and Micro Mesh)', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, '30.00', 'W 25" × D 25"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 99, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:19:58.536Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.661Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"collection":"Table Bases","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/table-bases/bar-table-base-table-base