(4943, 'Volante 31" x 56" Occasional Height Volante Aluminum Fire Pit', 'owlee-volante-31-x-56-occasional-height-volante-aluminum-fire-pit-5113-3156o-vo', '5113-3156O-VO', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 'The Volante Fire Pit from O.W. Lee combines contemporary design with innovative materials to create a fire feature that is both visually striking and exceptionally durable. Crafted from lightweight, rustproof aluminum and topped with ultra-resilient Dekton®, Volante is engineered for modern outdoor living. Handcrafted in the USA, Volante offers customization with 10 aluminum frame finishes and two sleek Dekton® tops. Available with manual or electronic ignition, each unit comes propane-ready and is easily convertible to natural gas. With two height options and two sizes, Volante is a true aluminum statement piece for sophisticated outdoor spaces.', 13, 45, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 19" × W 56" × D 31"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 131, TRUE, '2026-06-02T00:20:00.257Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.316Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"19","collection":"Volante","source_url":"https://www.owlee.com/collections/casual-fireside/30-x-50-occasional-height-volante-aluminum-fire-pit/","weight_lbs":"150 (pkg)","spec_sheet_pdf":"https://www.owlee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Fire-Pits_Retail_SpecSheet_2026__5123-3156O-Volante-Occ.pdf","depth_length_in":"31",