This base fits the following top: - 42x120" (Porcelain only)', 'Sleek, minimal, and designed for contemporary outdoor living, our Modern Aluminum table bases provide a clean foundation for any table top. Crafted from durable, powder-coated aluminum, they are lightweight yet built to withstand the elements--resistant to rust, corrosion, and fading. Their streamlined design pairs effortlessly with porcelain, Dekton, or micro mesh tops and complements our Arc, Aris, Avana, and Studio collections, making them a versatile choice for both residential and commercial settings. Combining modern style with long-lasting performance, these bases are as practical as they are elegant.
This base fits the following top: - 42x120" (Porcelain only)', 13, 44, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'H 28" × W 67" × D 32"', FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 292, TRUE, '2026-06-17T00:26:10.466Z'::timestamptz, '2026-06-17T00:27:48.670Z'::timestamptz, 0, '{"height_in":"28","collection":"Table Bases","depth_length_in":"32","width_diameter_in":"67"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'fixed', NULL, '["o-w-lee","table-bases","made-in-usa"]'::jsonb, TRUE, NULL),
(5247, 'Table Tops 24 Round Porcelain Top', 'owlee-table-tops-table-tops-24-round-porcelain-top-table-tops-24-round-porcelain-top', 'Table_Tops_24_Round_Porcelain_Top', 'Our 24" porcelain table tops are designed to pair seamlessly with any of our 01 table bases and are available in a selection of 16 porcelain finishes. Each top is thoughtfully constructed in three durable layers and finished with a protective metal rim for long-lasting performance outdoors.
At the core is a lightweight aluminum honeycomb substrate that provides exceptional strength without added weight. This advanced structure creates a stable foundation that resists bending and warping, even in changing temperatures. The porcelain tiles are permanently bonded to the substrate using a waterproof epoxy adhesive, creating a stronger, longer-lasting bond than traditional tile methods.
